        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="陀螺仪积分"><a href="#陀螺仪积分" class="headerlink" title="陀螺仪积分"></a>陀螺仪积分</h2><h2 id="加速度计重力约束"><a href="#加速度计重力约束" class="headerlink" title="加速度计重力约束"></a>加速度计重力约束</h2><h2 id="动态融合VS静态融合"><a href="#动态融合VS静态融合" class="headerlink" title="动态融合VS静态融合"></a>动态融合VS静态融合</h2><h2 id="滤波"><a href="#滤波" class="headerlink" title="滤波"></a>滤波</h2><h3 id="互补滤波"><a href="#互补滤波" class="headerlink" title="互补滤波"></a>互补滤波</h3><h3 id="Mahony"><a href="#Mahony" class="headerlink" title="Mahony"></a>Mahony</h3><h3 id="Madgwick"><a href="#Madgwick" class="headerlink" title="Madgwick"></a>Madgwick</h3><h3 id="EKF"><a href="#EKF" class="headerlink" title="EKF"></a>EKF</h3>]]></content>
      
      
